# darling_core 0.20.11

Helper crate for proc-macro library for reading attributes into structs when
implementing custom derives. Use https://crates.io/crates/darling in your code.

- crates.io: https://crates.io/crates/darling_core/0.20.11
- Repository: https://github.com/TedDriggs/darling
- Documentation: https://docs.rs/darling_core/0.20.11
- License: MIT

The package as published on crates.io carries no README. incan.pub wrote this one when it adopted the package as the Loaf `crates-io/darling_core`.
